<request-parameters>
<!--
  DRAFT -- validate with --dump before a real run. D74 = "Compressed
  Mortality, 1968-1978" (ICD-8 era). The ICD-8 twin of
  mortality_icd9_sub.xml, one level finer than mortality_icd8_chapter.xml:
    B_1  = D74.V1          (Year)
    B_2  = D74.V2-level2   (ICD Sub-Chapter -- ~70 groups)
    O_aar = aar_std + O_aar_enable = true   (age-adjusted; 2000 US std pop)

  See mortality_icd9_sub.xml for the rationale: sub-chapter grain so a few
  specific rankable causes can extend back before 1979, mapped only where
  a sub-chapter lines up with an ICD-10 113-list cause; no comparability
  ratio, seams at 1979 / 1999. D74 has no Injury-Intent section (no
  V12 / V13). Location V_ fields BLANK. {{YEAR_LIST}} -> V_D74.V1.
  Response cells: year, sub-chapter (label, h= depth), Deaths, Population,
  Crude Rate, Age-Adjusted Rate -> the same 6-col contract as `icd9` /
  `icd10`.

  Test: node --env-file=.env fetch.js --type=mortality --era=icd8_sub --years=1968-1970 --out=rows.json --dump
  On a 400: paste the <message> from pipeline/mortality_icd8_sub.raw.xml.
-->
